item.betterwithsouls.tomahawk_stone.name = Stone Tomahawk
item.betterwithsouls.tomahawk_stone.desc = Simple, yet deadly weapon, meant to be used in close combat and to be thrown to strike those at distance

item.betterwithsouls.shortsword_stone.name= Stone Shortsword
item.betterwithsouls.shortsword_stone.desc= Slay pesky enemies with this sharp stone blade!

item.betterwithsouls.claymore.name= Claymore
item.betterwithsouls.claymore.desc= This larger type of greatsword is normally wielded with two hands due to its weight. This highly flexible greatsword can be used to attack in swings or thrusts.

item.betterwithsouls.item_dummy.name= Item Dummy
item.betterwithsouls.item_dummy.desc= !!DEBUG!! Poseable first person item for animation purposes..

item.betterwithsouls.pose_dummy.name= Pose Dummy
item.betterwithsouls.pose_dummy.desc= !!DEBUG!! Poseable biped bro for animation purposes. Spawn him through magic wand.

item.betterwithsouls.item_animator.name= Poser Tool
item.betterwithsouls.item_animator.desc= !!DEBUG!! Helper item for animation purposes, allows to pose a model and dump it to console. NOTE: mob has to be rendered at least once and be instance of 'BWSMob' class.

item.betterwithsouls.sacrificering.name= Ring of Sacrifice
item.betterwithsouls.sacrificering.desc= Its wearer will lose nothing upon death, but the ring itself breaks.

item.betterwithsouls.sacrificering_broken.name= Broken ring of Sacrifice
item.betterwithsouls.sacrificering_broken.desc= Ring is broken, wearer will still lose everything upon death, but the ring itself doesn't leave the wearer. Can be repaired.

item.betterwithsouls.sacrificering_rare.name= Rare ring of Sacrifice
item.betterwithsouls.sacrificering_rare.desc= Its wearer will lose nothing upon death, the ring will not leave its wearer.

item.betterwithsouls.armor_wooden_helmet.name= Wooden helmet
item.betterwithsouls.armor_wooden_helmet.desc= A hat made of tree bark.
item.betterwithsouls.armor_wooden_chestplate.name= Wooden chestplate
item.betterwithsouls.armor_wooden_chestplate.desc= A chestplate made of tree bark.
item.betterwithsouls.armor_wooden_pants.name= Wooden pants
item.betterwithsouls.armor_wooden_pants.desc= Pants made of tree bark.
item.betterwithsouls.armor_wooden_boots.name= Wooden boots
item.betterwithsouls.armor_wooden_boots.desc= Boots made of tree bark, oof what a tyagi...
armor_material.wood.desc= Weak defence against physical damage, soul of nature gives wooden armor protection against darkness.

